Live loads as a package beside the real editor and starts an owned native worker
An actual editor edit publishes into the shared buffer without changing running code
Rehearsal and publication preserve the native PID and world-owned traffic
An invalid state conversion is refused while the old worker and original client traffic continue
Choosing an earlier behavior creates a new version and preserves current work and later source edits
